<title>USA: Arizona Public Svc workers take severance.</title>
<headline>Arizona Public Svc workers take severance.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arizona Public Service Co said 655 employees took voluntary severances offered last month.</p>
<p>As a result, the company expects to take a one-time, after-tax charge, of about $20 million in the 1996 fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
